# Animate Dead is an Aura spell that targets a creature card in a graveyard. Bot1's Ornithopter dies on turn 1; on turn 3
# Bot1 casts Animate Dead on it and Bot2 answers with Ghost Vacuum, exiling the target. The target is illegal on resolution,
# so the spell is countered (CR 608.2b) and goes to the graveyard without ever entering: no Ornithopter returns and
# nothing is sacrificed.

